        "config": {
          "model": "gpt-5.5",
          "max_tokens": 900,
          "temperature": 0.75,
          "system_prompt": "You write the 'after' still prompt for a hyperlapse city morph about language learning.\n\nThe attached before-image fixes framing, subject identity and camera position. Change ONLY what the change contract names; everything else \u2014 pose, crop, background geometry, focal length \u2014 stays identical so the reveal cuts cleanly.\n\nLight with a hard fresnel through an egg-crate grid for a crisp-edged shadow and grade to high-contrast teal-and-orange with protected mid-tone skin.\n\nReturn one prompt paragraph only.",
